#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Local Co-op"
msgstr "本地同屏"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Two heroes, one screen - session active"
msgstr "双英雄，同一屏幕 — 会话进行中"

#: ModEntry.cs
