msgstr "本地同屏"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "设备"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "相机"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Player 2 skin"
msgstr "二号英雄外观"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Keep these devices"
msgstr "保持这些设备"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Start local co-op"
msgstr "开始本地同屏"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Player one's input device."
msgstr "玩家 1 的输入设备。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Turn the session off; new runs are single-player again."
msgstr "关闭会话；之后的新游戏将恢复单人模式。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Follow both heroes and zoom the one window so both stay visible, or follow player 1 only."
msgstr "让一个窗口跟随两名英雄并自动缩小以同屏显示，或仅跟随玩家 1。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "How far the camera may zoom out to keep both heroes on screen."
msgstr "相机最多能缩小到什么程度，以确保两名英雄都在画面内。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Player two's outfit. Defaults to a skin different from player one's; cycles every wearable skin in the game, then 'same as P1'. Takes effect on the next run."
msgstr "二号英雄的装扮。默认选用与玩家 1 不同的外观；会遍历游戏中所有可穿戴外观，最后回到『与 P1 相同』。下一局生效。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Start a run from the main menu to play together. Either hero dying ends the run."
msgstr "从主菜单开始游戏即可一起游玩。任一英雄死亡都会结束本局。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Start a run from the main menu to play together."
msgstr "从主菜单开始游戏即可一起游玩。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Session active: every new run uses two heroes."
msgstr "会话进行中：每局新游戏都会使用双英雄。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Two heroes share health, inventory and attributes. Pick a device for each player."
msgstr "两名英雄共享生命、背包与属性。请为每位玩家选择设备。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "One window for both heroes: follow both and zoom out, or follow player 1 only."
msgstr "两名英雄共用一个窗口：跟随两人并缩小，或仅跟随玩家 1。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Give player two its own outfit."
msgstr "为二号英雄单独设置外观。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Camera follows both heroes and zooms out to {0}"
msgstr "相机跟随两名英雄并缩小至 {0}"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Camera follows player 1"
msgstr "相机仅跟随玩家 1"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "both heroes (zoom out)"
msgstr "两名英雄（自动缩小）"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "player 1 only"
msgstr "仅玩家 1"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Shared health, equipment, friendly fire and player two's skin."
msgstr "共享血量、装备、友伤与二号英雄皮肤。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "LOCAL CO-OP / RULES"
msgstr "本地同屏 / 规则"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Shared health: {0}   < Toggle >"
msgstr "共享血量：{0}   < 切换 >"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "shared"
msgstr "共享"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "independent"
msgstr "独立"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Share one health pool between both heroes, or give each hero its own life. Independent: a downed hero stays down (run continues) and revives at 1 HP on the next level; the run ends only when all heroes are down."
msgstr "两名英雄共享同一血池，或各自拥有独立血量。独立时：倒地的英雄保持倒地（本局继续），下一关卡以 1 血复活；只有所有英雄都倒地才结束本局。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Friendly fire: {0}   < Toggle >"
msgstr "友伤：{0}   < 切换 >"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "on"
msgstr "开"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "off"
msgstr "关"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Let the two heroes damage each other."
msgstr "允许两名英雄互相造成伤害。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Camera: {0} | Health: {1}"
msgstr "相机：{0} | 血量：{1}"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Equipment: {0} | Friendly fire: {1}"
msgstr "装备：{0} | 友伤：{1}"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Equipment: {0}   < Toggle >"
msgstr "装备：{0}   < 切换 >"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Share one backpack between both heroes, or give each hero its own weapons, skills, scroll tiers and flask. Shared: the flask, the tiers, the ring, the mutations and the item cooldowns are one shared set. Independent: gold, cells and unlocks stay shared."
msgstr "两名英雄共用同一个背包，或各自拥有武器、技能、卷轴层数与血瓶。共享时：血瓶、卷轴层数、戒指、变异与道具冷却都是同一份。独立时：金币、细胞与解锁仍然共享。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "LOCAL CO-OP / MOD SETTINGS"
msgstr "本地同屏 / 模组设置"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "LOCAL CO-OP / INPUT DEVICES"
msgstr "本地同屏 / 输入设备"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "LOCAL CO-OP / MOD INFO"
msgstr "本地同屏 / 模组信息"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Mod settings"
msgstr "模组设置"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Input devices"
msgstr "输入设备"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Mod info"
msgstr "模组信息"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Version: {0}"
msgstr "版本：{0}"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Local co-op for Dead Cells on the DCCM MDK."
msgstr "基于 DCCM MDK 的《死亡细胞》本地同屏模组。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Two heroes, one window, one device per player."
msgstr "两位英雄、一个窗口、每人一个输入设备。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Camera and the run rules: shared health, equipment, friendly fire, player two's skin."
msgstr "相机与对局规则：共享血量、装备、友伤、二号英雄皮肤。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Version and what this mod does."
msgstr "版本与本模组的功能简介。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "auto (differs from P1)"
msgstr "自动（与 P1 不同）"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "same as P1"
msgstr "与 P1 相同"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Shared health, equipment and friendly fire."
msgstr "共享血量、装备与友伤。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "PVP ARENA"
msgstr "PVP 竞技场"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "PvP arena"
msgstr "PVP 竞技场"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Two players, one arena, own health and forced friendly fire."
msgstr "两名玩家，一座竞技场：各自拥有血量，并且强制互相伤害。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "PvP mode: {0}   < Toggle >"
msgstr "PVP 模式：{0}   < 切换 >"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Off: the two heroes cooperate as usual. On: the arena is played, where each hero has its own health and they always damage each other."
msgstr "关闭：两名英雄照常合作。开启：进入竞技场，每名英雄都有自己的血量，并且始终可以互相伤害。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Rounds to win: {0}   < Change >"
msgstr "夺冠回合数：{0}   < 更改 >"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "How many rounds a player must take to win the match."
msgstr "一名玩家需要赢下多少回合才能赢下整场比赛。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Start a match now"
msgstr "立即开始一场比赛"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Start a match   (last: P{0} {1})"
msgstr "开始一场比赛   （上一场：P{0} {1}）"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Opens the arena: both players fight in an empty training hall — no mobs, no loot, no exit. Leave with the pause menu; the score panel sits in the top-left corner. Gear follows the Rules setting."
msgstr "进入竞技场：两名玩家在一座空旷的训练厅里对决——没有怪物、没有掉落、没有出口。用暂停菜单离开；比分显示在屏幕左上角。装备遵循规则页的设置。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Two players, one arena: own health, forced friendly fire, first to the round target wins."
msgstr "两名玩家，一座竞技场：各自拥有血量、强制互相伤害，先达到目标回合数者获胜。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "MOD SETTINGS   v{0}"
msgstr "模组设置   v{0}"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Let the two heroes damage each other. In a PvP match this is forced on."
msgstr "允许两名英雄互相伤害。在 PVP 比赛中此项强制开启。"

#: Coop/LocalCoop.TeleportHint.cs
msgid "Hold {0} to go back"
msgstr "按住 {0} 键返回"

#: Coop/LocalCoop.TeleportHint.cs
msgid "Hold {0} to teleport"
msgstr "按住 {0} 键传送"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "PVP ARENA / MATCH RULES"
msgstr "PVP 竞技场 / 比赛规则"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Match rules"
msgstr "比赛规则"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "How long a match lasts, and how much health each hero has."
msgstr "比赛持续多久，以及每名英雄有多少血量。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Health: {0}   < Change >"
msgstr "血量：{0}   < 更改 >"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "How much health each hero has in a match: the normal pool, or 2x / 5x / 10x it, so a round lasts longer. Applies to both heroes, so the duel stays even."
msgstr "每名英雄在比赛中拥有多少血量：正常血量，或它的 2 倍 / 5 倍 / 10 倍，让一个回合更耐打。对双方同时生效，因此对决仍然公平。"

#: ModEntry.cs
msgid "Both heroes enter with {0} their normal life pool."
msgstr "两名英雄都以正常血量的 {0} 进入竞技场。"

